{"job_id":"F-055cedca5d9f13c281e4","family_id":"F-055cedca5d9f13c281e4","title":"제주특별자치도 설치 및 국제자유도시 조성을 위한 특별법 제363조제5항에 따른 범칙금 양정기준에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":59,"target_id":"10e98f6fc95f025190a3bb53da7dd930486a7952b31bad8eb8184f7e948e0625","source_hash":"6e0c5622c795429cd932d29d33e303e4f602ad563ffb7f6298f883c4244783df","text":"根据《济州特别自治道设立及国际自由城市设立特别法》第363条第5款确定罚款标准的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":86,"target_id":"ee1c35c040a0a835ffd35d8a943714eaf673f01984231f68308d3479ccf52aa5","source_hash":"28a794204c67492de666dabe553d174ff63bf43676d5d796ceceab15063f4281","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是确立根据《济州特别自治道设立及国际自由城市设立特别法》第363条第5款确定罚款金额的标准。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":189,"target_id":"9d1ce5f706a44e23e468750f84015939c34eb9f69e5dfe704de7b514d826aeeb","source_hash":"dd5e2610549bccba31a76b1380c0c8977c15b8ca00ef38595d286c39dab63860","text":"第二条（罚款标准）根据《济州特别自治道设立及国际自由城市设立特别法》（以下简称“本法”）第355条规定，对触犯本法所列罪行的人处以罚款的标准如下表所示。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"BODY","start":189,"end":483,"target_id":"4d36febfa5af4be111dfd7c76d545d760504dd25b43e1db5c40659afb7b78531","source_hash":"898f30d9239c020000226d5a3e41ecfad1e2a27f3a3820fd3f47d2dc205e7857","text":"第三条（减免罚款）\n① 根据第二条规定，罚款可减少至多一半，但应考虑违法者的年龄和情况、违法行为的动机和后果、支付罚款的能力以及违法次数。\n② 尽管有第1款的规定，但移民局局长、移民局分局局长或外国人拘留中心负责人如欲将罚款减少超过确定罚款标准金额的一半，须事先向法务部长提交证明理由的材料予以批准。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"BODY","start":483,"end":505,"target_id":"ecfde99303bcf21d49e8cae82697f895f99d9bcf05cf3b12c62abb9f59177252","source_hash":"f2df28b3a4715e118ad4612549a3411a6120aefc8ddabcfd79958a36d967d54a","text":"补充规定 <2007年5月25日 第611号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"BODY","start":505,"end":536,"target_id":"5b3d0f5e615a51cf3fed5f8f5aeeb5a073c580ddc0db42afad0b58627cba008d","source_hash":"90858a9f0619781fd12c847a12960234f781a731d8df4c39550910624927ded0","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"BODY","start":536,"end":2335,"target_id":"6142aa363ccb5f3e62cea9b13c46d3083f277b1d6eb1a56549eec69d0cbc3a4d","source_hash":"0c9f751cd607f8fe060084585680c1e9e47376aa8ec50bddf44bbe6c52e22bf3","text":"第二条（废止其他法律）废止《济州国际自由城市特别法》第112条第5款所规定违法行为罚款标准规则。\n\n罚款确定标准 [与第 2 条相关]\n[星号]                                                                                    \n\n  罚款确定标准（与第2条相关）                                                             \n\n┏━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━┓\n\n┃相关条款│须处以罚款│标准罚款金额┃\n\n┠───────┼──────────────────────────┼─────────┨\n\n┃1. 《移民和国籍法》第355条 │违反《移民和国籍法》第158条第1款，将外国人视为群体对待 │1000万韩元以上 ┃\n\n┃第一条第一款│迁往共和国境内其他地区或促成此类迁徙│5000万韩元以下┃\n\n┃ │ （仅限营利性活动） │ ┃\n\n┠───────┼──────────────────────────┼─────────┨\n\n┃2. 《移民和国籍法》第355条 │违反《移民和国籍法》第158条第2款，将外国人视为群体对待 │1000万韩元以上 ┃\n\n┃第一条第二款│为迁往大韩民国境内其他地区，船舶/航空器│5000万韩元以下┃\n\n┃ │ 提供飞机或其他交通工具或护照的人员（营利性） │ ┃\n\n┃ │) │ ┃\n\n┠───────┼──────────────────────────┼─────────┨\n\n┃3. 违反《法案》第355条 │韩国境内其他地区违反《法案》第158条第3款 │金额超过1000万韩元 ┃\n\n┃第一条第三款│集体隐瞒已迁居或正在迁居至│5000万韩元以下的外国人┃\n\n┃ │或导致逃脱，或为此目的，船舶或飞机或│ ┃\n\n┃ │提供其他交通工具的人（以营利为目的） │ ┃\n\n┃ │ 仅限于此行为) │ ┃\n\n┠───────┼──────────────────────────┼─────────┨\n\n┃4. 法第355条 │符合法第355条第1款任何一项规定的人（执行令 │300万韩元以上 ┃\n\n┃第二段 │非搬迁目的人员） │3000万韩元或以下 ┃\n\n┠───────┼──────────────────────────┼─────────┨\n\n┃5. 《居留法》第355条 │如未取得依据《居留法》第157条第1款扩大居留区域的许可 │200万韩元以上 ┃\n\n┃第3段，第1款│移居韩国境内其他地区且无│2000万韩元或以下收入的人┃\n\n┠───────┼──────────────────────────┼─────────┨\n\n┃6. 法第355条 │违反法第158条的人，依据法第355条第1款或 │200万韩元以上 ┃\n\n"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00001","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610708","source_hash":"810887963502c1f110e51796f1290318a00f115ef05a52612a8b0a60024f1e2f","text":"[星号]"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00002","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610709","source_hash":"3788c058f2e6cf10fe9cbc5e0a40307f97f5c5162a46f7cabfe4a3cf70374841","text":"确定违法行为罚款的标准（与第2条相关）"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00003","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610710","source_hash":"84df63cbb1bf99d7ea7b02d6d360fb042524a7bf728023ee209f8e4d819b1843","text":"相关法律条款"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00004","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610711","source_hash":"6141d789223b45768702a163981c8093c451e13e417c1a17e210d323097535d0","text":"须缴纳罚款"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00005","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610712","source_hash":"033fa2c01d39562475a1e8e83f14358c16c98e0ac096b36b01e3bfceafa127ff","text":"罚款确定标准金额"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00006","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610713","source_hash":"964006d31c87b9988c3bf076a49b5466459c50bb1374b5b14ced384debc0da0f","text":"1. 法案第355条"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00007","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610714","source_hash":"0512a7a8003fae8de63cad56b14b88755ca761a3efa3e7173f8b7496feb510c1","text":"关于外国人集体违反该法第158条第1款的规定"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00008","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610715","source_hash":"019076924252db397cda22df376505c4b50735dbf441e57563d8fd05868d362d","text":"1000万韩元或以上"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00009","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610716","source_hash":"6c4f72981a15893339e07da6759ec70df03b4b8d236aebfff2ab284da43647df","text":"段落 1 第 1 段"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00010","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610717","source_hash":"e68a7cc26007ef44b3d3237c4c651add643364e91c2c5dcb3155b1b4eaa90fa9","text":"迁往共和国境内的另一个地区或促成此事"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00011","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610718","source_hash":"b8880ef8a46e33853b350f8cb68a90ecb382e9c949000403af83f2614aff6b9f","text":"5000万韩元或以下"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00012","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610719","source_hash":"a211e0d78ff810e2db55e0b86f4e63d8a27f25efe1d04f578a69f6933d7bf122","text":"（仅限营利性活动）"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00013","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610720","source_hash":"22a69a281fabaa2f03ba896b148f4facc7b4141736ea4f3fd5c04e5353492c0e","text":"2. 法案第355条"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00014","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610721","source_hash":"19a98a2c01d62baad9004a731009b258f89181bf1c7c173b2cdb72304754e0d2","text":"对外国人进行集体对待，违反了该法第158条第2款的规定。"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00015","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610722","source_hash":"019076924252db397cda22df376505c4b50735dbf441e57563d8fd05868d362d","text":"1000万韩元或以上"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00016","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610723","source_hash":"421c7b60ad5cdc158d4503f2c2f520686960bc9505e644ca4e1c8cbe6042bb3e","text":"第 1 段，第 2 子段"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00017","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610724","source_hash":"31e99181184f71bb7aa793dc11e37653c8ad62b126cce82542a0a072ef5fdd5d","text":"乘船或飞机前往共和国境内的另一个地区"},{"id":"A35847-zh-00018","doc":"A35847","law_id":"kr-010454-79204-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2610725","source_hash":"b8880ef8a